{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、不等号聞いてくれましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！67回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nしゃちさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/28/7132061/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の今頃は\n夜ご飯の後にお腹が減って\n夜の23時頃～1時ごろまでの間に\nファーストフードを食べていた頃だと思います！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分、去年のあと1ヶ月くらい先から\nダイエット始めてると思うので\n今年もそういうプランでいこうかな。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ね！\n夜寝る前になると無性にパンが食べたくてしょうがなくなるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスももちろん食べてるけど\n最近は本当にパン！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パンにはまってる！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日も夜パンをいくつか食べて\n朝起きたら胃もたれしてたはずが\n会場に着いたらミルクフランスパンを\n食べたよね(´ー｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミルクフランスパンの\nミルクの部分を主にたべた(´ー｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しいね(´ー｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！今年こそ！\nたくさんやりたいことを叶えられるように\n頑張りたいです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、妹と\n舞台のじょしらくの動画を見て\nここ最近また「じょしらくロス」感が\nきてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあんな素敵な時間や景色がみれたら\nいいな～(ノ_・。)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も握手会で何回か\nきぐちゃんのセリフ言ったんだよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか握手会で、きぐちゃんになれたらいいな～！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンクの和服に金髪外はね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/28/7132061/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/28/7132061/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/28/7132061/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、13枚目最後の個別握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"in 京都パルスブラザ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服は2着きて\n1部にセーラー服もどきのワンピースと\n2部にセーラー服もどきのワンピース➕ベレー帽かぶって\n3部に46時間テレビののぎ天の時の服をきたんだけど、\n洋服はまた明日のブログに載せます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、らりんさんの最後の個別握手会で\n1部おわりに卒業セレモニーが行われたので\nその話をします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部おわりにあったので\nそのあともたくさんの方と近くで話すから\n泣かないぞ！と決めてたのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初の嫉妬の権利のイントロを聴いた瞬間から\nあー、もうこれダメだー。\nと思ってすぐに泣きました。。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この2日間でらりんさんのこと許してや！\nって言ってくれるファンの方もたくさんいましたが、\n私は断じて許さん！！！と言ってました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんの泣いてるところは\n滅多にみたことがなかったけど\nらりんさんは卒業を発表してから\nよく泣いてると思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、いつもすぐに笑ってくれて\n周りを明るくしてくれます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんが夢を叶えるために\n卒業されることは素敵なことだと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを一生懸命笑って\nらりんさんを思って送り出そうとしている\n皆さんをみたら\n私もそろそろ意地を張ってないで\n心構えしなきゃ！と思いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ、らりんさんには怒ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怒ってる理由はたくさんあります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきならりんさんだから怒ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんは許してよ～ねえ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくるけど私は意地っ張りで頑固なので絶対に許しません！と答えてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話がめちゃくちゃになってるけど\nらりんさんのことは怒ってるけど\nらりんさんが安心して卒業できるように\nらりんさんの卒業ライブが素敵なライブになるように、\nこの数日間で大きくなりたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/28/7132061/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/28/7132061/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/28/7132061/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/28/7132061/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  つっちーさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎すき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎ありがとうございます！\n私もみなさんのことかだいすきです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  takayaさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎今日の握手会行ったよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎昨日はありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても楽しかったです(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  たしさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎初めて握手会参加したー めっちゃ緊張したけど福岡からわざわざ来て良かったー(￣Д￣)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎わざわざ、福岡から会いに来てくださり本当にありがとうこざいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと仲良くなって、もっとお話しできる日が早くきたらいいな～٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(228)  たくま  ななあしゅきーさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きたのひなお！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎いや！きたのひなこね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"'お'じゃなくて\n\"こ\"だからね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"き！た！の！ひ！な！こ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  ともともさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎キイちゃんコメント選んでブロブで書いてくれるから好き笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎その好きも好きと一緒だから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいですよ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ちょっと変わってる好きですね！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな、今日はセレクト番号に当たったので\nセレクトしました！\nいつもコメントありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(717)  受験生のほりさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎これから乃木ののでの不等号楽しみにしています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎聞いてくれましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までにない曲調でとてもすきです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲のアレンジがすごく好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/28/7132061/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレはここまで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあしたー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！！"}],"source":"archive"}